<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Excel said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Excel said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette reduced the rating on Excel Communications Inc to market perform from buy, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 4-3/8 to 23-5/8.</p>
